items.description:
Gliglish is like having a language tutor in your pocket, but instead of a human, it's an AI. You practice speaking and listening to your target language whenever and wherever you want. It:

- gets you talking!
- includes translations;
- corrects your grammar;
- lets you choose the speaking speed;
- lets you ask questions in your native language;
- And if you're ever stuck for words, it helps you along by suggesting what to say next.

